## ✅ Checklist Before Starting Frontend Work

- [ ] Do I know what the visual problem is? If NO → Use Playwright Browser first
- [ ] Is this an email template? If YES → Use inline styles + test in Mailpit
- [ ] Am I using DaisyUI semantic colors? If NO → Fix it
- [ ] Have I checked if similar component works elsewhere? If NO → Compare implementations
- [ ] Am I testing in both light and dark modes? If NO → Test both

---

**Following these rules will save 80% of debugging time and prevent frustration.**

